        ("Crews", [
            "A crew is up to 8 people who share a tower for the day. Crews need iOS 26 or later. Crews are kept in Some Wins' own area of Apple's iCloud, not in anyone's personal iCloud, so a crew uses none of your iCloud storage. Some Wins runs no server of its own.",
